shkumarradha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-14T08:57:18Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T08:57:18Z","body":"Per-call-kind breakdown of the same log window, same grouping ((run, node, model) in time order), both calls in a transition carrying ≥2000 prompt tokens:\n\n```\ntag     transitions   hop%    miss | same endpoint     miss | hopped\nturn        328       23.5%     23/251 =  9.2%          32/77  = 41.6%\ntask        110       80.0%      0/22  =  0.0%          32/88  = 36.4%\nleaf        197       10.7%     13/176 =  7.4%          13/21  = 61.9%\n```\n\nThe task road is the worst of the three: **80% of consecutive task calls change machine**, and every full cache miss on that road is on a call that had just hopped — none at all on the 22 transitions that stayed. It matches the aggregate hit rates over the same window:\n\n```\ntag     calls   prompt tokens   cached tokens   hit%       $\nturn     2061      52,263,959      40,825,510   78.1   22.78\ntask     1396      28,125,428      13,183,855   46.9    5.22\nleaf      535       8,760,307       7,440,268   84.9    0.79\n```\n\n`task` sits at 46.9% against `turn`'s 78.1% and `leaf`'s 84.9%, on 28M prompt tokens. Whatever the fix does for the conversation, the task road needs it more.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/comments/5661491854/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"santoshkumarradha","id":29346072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzQ2MDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29346072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha","html_url":"https://github.com/santoshkumarradha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/comments/5661511940","html_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1029#issuecomment-5661511940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1029","id":5661511940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOTu5AHM8AAAABUXPRBA","user":{"login":"santoshkumarradha","id":29346072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzQ2MDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29346072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha","html_url":"https://github.com/santoshkumarradha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-14T08:59:11Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T08:59:11Z","body":"Second, stricter estimate of the money, using a five-minute warm window instead of just the immediately preceding call.\n\nFor every call with ≥2000 prompt tokens, `expected` = the largest prompt any call in the same (run, node, model) lineage sent in the previous five minutes (capped at this call's own prompt — i.e. what a warm neighbour could have served); `unwarmed` = `expected − cached_tokens`, priced at `prompt_price − cache_read_price` from the model catalog. Same log window (2026-09-12T11:53 → 2026-09-14T04:50, 1.71 days).\n\n```\nprevious call on the SAME machine : 643 calls,  3,362,771 unwarmed tokens,  $1.25  (mean $0.0020/call)\nprevious call on ANOTHER machine  : 828 calls, 20,335,213 unwarmed tokens, $11.02  (mean $0.0133/call)\n```\n\nHolding the hopped calls to the same-machine mean:\n\n```\nexcess attributable to hopping: $9.40 over 1.71 days = $5.50/day\nevery unwarmed prefix byte:    $12.27 over 1.71 days = $7.18/day\n```\n\n$5.50/day against $31.80/day of recorded spend in the same window — about one dollar in six, and it agrees with the independent full-miss estimate in the issue body ($5.40/day) to within two per cent.\n\nOne more fact worth having on the issue: **the pin ledger is process-local in-memory with no expiry** (`sharedPins` in `internal/provider/affinity.go`, and the type comment says so). So even under `latency` a pin exists only inside one long-lived process — `aforge chat --once`, `aforge do` and every headless door start cold every time. Verified on the wire: six `--once` turns under `routing: latency` all sent `{\"sort\":\"latency\", \"allow_fallbacks\":true, \"require_parameters\":true, \"max_price\":{…}}` and **no `order`** on any of them. That is correct for a memory ledger and is not the defect here, but it means a fix that only reaches the interactive surface leaves the headless doors where they are.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/comments/5661511940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"santoshkumarradha","id":29346072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzQ2MDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29346072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha","html_url":"https://github.com/santoshkumarradha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/comments/5661684448","html_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1029#issuecomment-5661684448","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/1029","id":5661684448,"node_id":"IC_kwDOTu5AHM8AAAABUXZy4A","user":{"login":"santoshkumarradha","id":29346072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzQ2MDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29346072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha","html_url":"https://github.com/santoshkumarradha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-14T09:14:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T09:14:00Z","body":"Field drive on the Spark, the real `bin/aforge chat` in tmux under the shipped default (`routing: simple`, `lane.talk: auto`, `deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash`), one long-lived process, seven turns about three minutes apart. Every turn was served by the same endpoint and the prefix was byte-stable, and the cache still went cold five times out of eight:\n\n```\n04:52:08  prompt 14037  cached  1536  hit 10.9%  $0.001146\n04:55:01  prompt 14201  cached  9728  hit 68.5%  $0.000580\n04:57:59  prompt 14279  cached 14080  hit 98.6%  $0.000276\n05:00:44  prompt 14341  cached     0  hit  0.0%  $0.001277\n05:03:35  prompt 14183  cached     0  hit  0.0%  $0.001269\n05:06:28  prompt 14468  cached  1536  hit 10.6%  $0.001182\n05:09:22  prompt 14530  cached     0  hit  0.0%  $0.001304\n```\n\nCold $0.00127 against warm $0.00028 — 4.6×, the same ratio again. That decay is the remote cache's own lifetime and not this build's doing, **but it is the reason the pin matters more than the hop rate alone suggests**: `internal/lane` already believes something about which endpoint is still holding a prefix (`PrefixHold = 5 * time.Minute`, `internal/lane/value.go`; priced in `cachedTokens` in `internal/lane/choose.go`), and under `simple` the chooser that would use that belief is only consulted when a lane is pinned. So the default turns off both halves at once: the pin that says *go back to the machine that holds your bytes*, and the belief that says *which machines still hold them*.\n\nFor contrast, the same six turns sent seconds apart rather than minutes apart hit 97–99% on every turn after the first. The 78.1% aggregate in the field log is the mixture of the two.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/comments/5661684448/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"santoshkumarradha","id":29346072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzQ2MDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29346072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha","html_url":"https://github.com/santoshkumarradha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscripti